  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Persecution Prospect",
    "summary": "During your Shooting phase, right after being **selected to shoot**, this unit may pick 1 enemy unit other than **MONSTERS** and **VEHICLES**. Then:\n\n- For the rest of the phase, its models may attack no other unit, and may attack that one only while it is eligible to be targeted.\n- If at least 1 of those attacks hits it, that unit becomes assailed (a label other rules refer to) once they are resolved, lasting until your next Shooting phase starts.\n- A unit that was assailed already becomes pinned as well, for the same duration.\n- A pinned unit has -2\" Move and -2 to its **Charge rolls**.",
    "citations": [
      {
